{"3665230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apparition: Player VS Players", "steam_appid": 3665230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apparition: Player VS Players</strong> is a 5-player asymmetric horror game where 4 ghost hunters face off against 1 player-controlled ghost. Work together to uncover what entity haunts the location or hunt down the living as the ghost yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, earn money, unlock powerful new tools, and customize both your hunter and safe house as you uncover the secrets behind every haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/GHOSTHUNTERS.png?t=1763493113\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost hunter, your mission is to identify what type of entity is haunting the area, complete dangerous objectives, and ultimately banish the spirit once and for all. Every investigation requires cooperation and careful use of equipment. EMF readers, Spirit Boxes, thermal cameras, Crucifixes, and Holy Water can all be the difference between life and death. After the team agrees on their conclusion, additional objectives appear, offering a chance for extra cash and experience, if you dare to stay longer. Completing every task allows the hunters to perform a final banishment ritual, freeing the location from its curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on teamwork. Stay close to your allies, keep your sanity high, and use medicine when needed. When the ghost begins its hunt, hide if possible, or use crucifixes to fight back. Being alone is dangerous, especially when your mind begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/GHOST.png?t=1763493113\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ghost, your single goal is simple, eliminate every intruder who dares to enter your place. Build up your manifestation energy to unleash terrifying interactions, trigger jump scares, and drain the hunters’ sanity before you strike. Each ghost type has a unique ability, either passive or active, allowing you to deceive, trap, or harm your victims. But be careful, overusing your powers might expose what kind of ghost you are to experienced hunters. Choose your moments wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can roam the map invisibly, listening to the hunters voices as they nervously communicate, throwing objects, setting traps, or causing eerie disturbances to drive them insane. Everything you do as the ghost lowers their sanity and brings them closer to panic, confusion, and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with random people or host a private lobby with friends. Whether you hunt or haunt, every match is a tense and unpredictable experience. Level up, buy better equipment, and personalize your safe house as you grow stronger with every investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends as 4 hunters against a random ghost, or even 5 friends in a private lobby and scare your friends.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apparition: Player VS Players</strong> is a 5-player asymmetric horror game where 4 ghost hunters face off against 1 player-controlled ghost. Work together to uncover what entity haunts the location or hunt down the living as the ghost yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, earn money, unlock powerful new tools, and customize both your hunter and safe house as you uncover the secrets behind every haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/0b68604419b23f45018acaca80f5726d.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/GHOSTHUNTERS.png?t=1763493113\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost hunter, your mission is to identify what type of entity is haunting the area, complete dangerous objectives, and ultimately banish the spirit once and for all. Every investigation requires cooperation and careful use of equipment. EMF readers, Spirit Boxes, thermal cameras, Crucifixes, and Holy Water can all be the difference between life and death. After the team agrees on their conclusion, additional objectives appear, offering a chance for extra cash and experience, if you dare to stay longer. Completing every task allows the hunters to perform a final banishment ritual, freeing the location from its curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on teamwork. Stay close to your allies, keep your sanity high, and use medicine when needed. When the ghost begins its hunt, hide if possible, or use crucifixes to fight back. Being alone is dangerous, especially when your mind begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/c1f9793c34fadb82f030a40861e724d6.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/GHOST.png?t=1763493113\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ghost, your single goal is simple, eliminate every intruder who dares to enter your place. Build up your manifestation energy to unleash terrifying interactions, trigger jump scares, and drain the hunters’ sanity before you strike. Each ghost type has a unique ability, either passive or active, allowing you to deceive, trap, or harm your victims. But be careful, overusing your powers might expose what kind of ghost you are to experienced hunters. Choose your moments wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can roam the map invisibly, listening to the hunters voices as they nervously communicate, throwing objects, setting traps, or causing eerie disturbances to drive them insane. Everything you do as the ghost lowers their sanity and brings them closer to panic, confusion, and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with random people or host a private lobby with friends. Whether you hunt or haunt, every match is a tense and unpredictable experience. Level up, buy better equipment, and personalize your safe house as you grow stronger with every investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.poster.avif?t=1763493113\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.webm?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/extras/389c991bfa1b0f7000cce170f88537ee.mp4?t=1763493113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends as 4 hunters against a random ghost, or even 5 friends in a private lobby and scare your friends.</p>", "short_description": "Apparition is a 5-player asymmetric horror game where 4 ghost hunters face off against a player-controlled ghost. Investigate haunted locations, gather evidence, complete objectives, and banish the entity, or become the ghost and hunt the living yourself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/73dfce5e5661c9f3de47b79de0fbe532217bca8b/header.jpg?t=1763493113", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/ae36dcb073832106f7bea98d4d1bf2c447c18175/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763493113", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665230/ae36dcb073832106f7bea98d4d1bf2c447c18175/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763493113", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB/ AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Stor